 158:../../util/ringbuff_util.c **** /**
 159:../../util/ringbuff_util.c ****  * \brief           Read data from buffer.
 160:../../util/ringbuff_util.c ****  * Copies data from buffer to `data` array and marks buffer as free for maximum `btr` number of byt
